meta {
  name: Stocktake Detail
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}/inventory/stocktakes/{{stocktake_id}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Owner/manager. One past stocktake with its lines (guide v25 §60). Another restaurant's stocktake returns 404.

  data.stocktake: id, notes, items_counted, counted_by { id, full_name }, counted_at.
  data.variances[]: same rows as Apply Stocktake (stock_before, counted_qty, variance, waste_qty, waste_reason, unexplained_variance, notes) plus
  - waste_cost: what the line's waste cost (null when no waste)
  - unexplained_cost: signed cost of the remaining adjustment (negative = missing, positive = found)
  data.totals: lines_short, lines_over, lines_matched, waste_cost, unexplained_loss, surplus_value.
}
